 kernel/fork.c      | 396 +---------------------------
 kernel/fork_task.c | 629 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 kernel/fork_task.h |  11 +
 4 files changed, 647 insertions(+), 391 deletions(-)
